# The kitty keyboard protocol's flag 1, disambiguate escape codes, pushed
# with CSI > 1 u and reported by CSI ? u: Escape, and text keys with Alt,
# Ctrl, Ctrl+Alt, Shift+Alt, Ctrl+Shift, Logo, Hyper and Meta, as
# CSI code ; modifiers u, the code the unshifted key; a text key alone or
# with Shift sends its text, with Lock too; Enter, Tab and Backspace keep
# their bytes alone and are CSI 13, 9 and 127 u with a modifier; the
# cursor, editing and function keys in the forms of the functional key
# table, DECCKM changing nothing; the modifier keys send nothing.
# spec: kitty's Comprehensive keyboard handling in terminals: Disambiguate escape codes, Key codes, Modifiers, Functional key definitions
# covers: input.kitty-keyboard
size 20 2
send "\e[>1u"
send "\e[?u"
key Escape
key Escape mods=shift
key Escape mods=lock
key a
key A mods=shift
key A mods=lock
key a mods=alt
key a mods=ctrl
key a mods=ctrl+alt
key A mods=shift+alt
key A mods=shift+ctrl
key a mods=ctrl+lock
key a mods=logo
key a mods=hyper
key a mods=meta
key i mods=ctrl
key m mods=ctrl
key [ mods=ctrl
key [ mods=alt
key space mods=ctrl
key 1 mods=ctrl
key Cyrillic_es mods=ctrl ascii=c
key Cyrillic_es
key Return
key Return mods=lock
key Tab
key BackSpace
key Return mods=shift
key Return mods=alt
key ISO_Left_Tab mods=shift
key Tab mods=ctrl
key BackSpace mods=ctrl
key Up
key Up mods=ctrl
key Home mods=shift
send "\e[?1h"
key Up
key F1
key F1 mods=shift
key F3
key F5 mods=shift
key F13
key Insert
key Delete mods=ctrl
key Menu
key 0x1008ff14
key Shift_L mods=shift
key Caps_Lock mods=lock
